[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1. 安装环境要求",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            117,
            332,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.1. 硬件环境",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            178,
            297,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "CPU：奔腾4及以上级别x86兼容处理器；华睿2号等嵌入式处理器",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            225,
            712,
            242
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "内存：256M",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            248,
            287,
            265
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "磁盘空间：开发机500M，运行机取决于应用大小",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            271,
            571,
            288
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "网络：10M 及以上支持 TCP/IP 协议以太网、RapidIO",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            294,
            586,
            312
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.2. 软件环境",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            338,
            297,
            359
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/6725590b1c0f57b6231bb32d590166487b95caf59f3bf8223c174e890d69abdc.jpg",
        "table_caption": [
            "表 1 臻融数据分发服务 DDS 系统软件软件环境要求"
        ],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>操作系统</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>系统最低版本</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>依赖环境</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>Windows</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>Windows XP</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>java-jdk1.8 以上</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            418,
            803,
            467
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2. 安装与配置",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            500,
            307,
            520
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.1. 安装",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            561,
            250,
            581
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第一步：双击安装包，启动安装程序，若杀毒软件或防火墙弹出警告，请允许安装程序运行或将安装程序添加到白名单。点击“下一步”。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            605,
            852,
            642
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/fcaa03516dbbc2667ab6525ac818e0b5988fc677cdb86cc5b74b81b1df534f85.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "第二步：选择安装路径后，并点击“安装”。"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            295,
            648,
            737,
            872
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/aa2c28f36a3b42f17a67fbfc17be4503f6b16ce26a827242af55716db604d128.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            295,
            91,
            737,
            316
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第三步：等待安装完成。",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            183,
            326,
            373,
            343
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/9f3c8098a033e60338c3019b6655ba3e61bdc1053547289bff10b05f23f3d580.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            295,
            350,
            737,
            576
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第四步：若安装过程中出现如下图所示的提示框，代表在本次安装之前，机器中已经安装过ZRDDS，此次安装会替换关于 ZRDDS的环境变量。点击”确定”。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            587,
            850,
            623
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/8210a0b00c5e335ebb806a45aaecc330bd43f1fae7f9d2c5d0cb79d37f4902ea.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            299,
            629,
            734,
            783
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第五步：安装程序会在系统中设置环境变量，为了使环境变量起效，需要重新启动计算机，用户在使用 ZRDDS之前重启即可。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            809,
            852,
            845
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/8ea34ee9549483a70713a1422b97183a0bc3c6a7549577fff857bca9d80f6717.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "第六步：安装完后，点击“完成”。"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            366,
            91,
            667,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/2390608ebb936f12992429669e501e2eb4660e0efbac3664060d03030c7a3a2c.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "至此，臻融数据分发服务DDS系统软件已经成功安装到计算机上。"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            295,
            278,
            736,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.2. ZRDDS 授权文件获取步骤",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            554,
            457,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 双击运行安装目录/bin/LicenceInfoUtil.exe 获取授权信息；",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            601,
            655,
            618
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 运行成功将会有提示，将同一目录的 zrddsregInfo.txt 或二维码 zrddsregInfo.bmp 发送给臻融软件科技有限公司；",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            625,
            852,
            664
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 接收臻融软件科技有限公司生成的授权文件zrddslicence.lic；",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            671,
            680,
            687
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 将授权文件放在ZRDDS安装目录或者ZRDDS运行程序同一目录即可完成ZRDDS应用授权；",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            694,
            850,
            733
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 授权文件仅能够在获取授权信息的那台机器上面使用。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            740,
            638,
            757
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.3. 创建数据类型支持文件",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            784,
            436,
            804
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由于 DDS 中允许用户使用自定义的数据类型进行数据发布和订阅，因此需要用户在使用 DDS 编写应用程序前定义所使用的数据类型。数据类型通过 IDL 文件定义，IDL 文件具体格式见ZRDDS用户手册第3 章。IDL文件编写完成后，需要使用到安装目录中bin目录下的zrddsgen.exe 进行编译，生成支持文件。zrddsgen.exe 通过命令行运行，需要使用 Windows中的命令提示符进入到其目录下运行，通常情况下的运行参数如下：",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            829,
            853,
            903
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "algorithm",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_footnote": [],
        "code_body": "假定用户定义的数据类型名称为 Foo，使用 zrddsgen.exe 生成的支持文件总共有五个，  \n分别为：Foo.java、FooDataRreader.java、FooSeq.java、FooDataWriter.java、FooTypeSupport.java。  \n使用zrddsgen.exe 生成的支持文件可以使用在所有ZRDDS支持的操作系统上。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            160,
            848,
            216
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            672,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "algorithm",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_footnote": [],
        "code_body": "zrddsgen.exe –i [inputFile] –d [outputDir] –l java",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            104,
            684,
            121
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中[inputFile]替换为用户的 IDL 文件，[outputDir]替换为支持文件输出的目录。更多参数的信息见ZRDDS用户手册第3 章。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            124,
            850,
            159
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4. 配置工程",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            240,
            297,
            260
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "在Windows平台上，臻融数据分发服务DDS支持多种IDE，此处以eclipse为例",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            285,
            794,
            303
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4.1. 创建工程",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            324,
            295,
            343
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 单击 File。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            369,
            297,
            386
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 单击 New。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            392,
            304,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 选择 Java Project，填写项目名，创建一个工程。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            414,
            586,
            431
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/bc591fa1cbffc03300ac20be256afae5ff72cee3521fbace167180cdc4c2d85d.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            221,
            436,
            631,
            840
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 将 zrddsgen.exe 生 成 的 文 件 添 加 到 工 程 （ Foo.java 、 FooDataRreader.java 、FooDataWriter.java、FooSeq、FooTypeSupport.java）。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            847,
            842,
            888
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4.2. 配置链接库",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            92,
            314,
            110
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4.2.1. 链接 ZRDDS\\_JAVA.jar",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            140,
            396,
            158
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 右键工程->properties->Java Bulid Path->Libraries 选择 Add External JARS…，选择安装目录下的 ZRDDS\\_JAVA.jar 文件。",
        "bbox": [
            179,
            184,
            852,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/0315a7b896bcef6b48052fb1fcb064cf2099687634d5e50be979a1fcada43bda.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            149,
            227,
            847,
            596
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4.2.2. 链接动态库 ZRDDS\\_JAVA.dll",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            620,
            457,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 右键工程->properties->Java Bulid Path->Source，展开工程目录，双击 Native librarylocation，External Folder…，选择安装目录下的 lib 目录。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            664,
            852,
            705
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/0b7ccfc281d8f1407bccb6e5a810332868e6dca4d4c8e7d55309a27aa515dbc5.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            149,
            85,
            848,
            455
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.4.3. 运行",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            479,
            253,
            497
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "直 接 添 加 main 函 数 或 者 使 用 编 译 器 –e 命 令 生 成 的 Foo\\_publication.java 或 者Foo\\_subscriber.java 编译运行即可。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            520,
            850,
            556
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.5. 命令行编译运行",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            580,
            366,
            600
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "使用 zrddsgen.exe 生成文件（Foo.java、FooDataRreader.java、FooDataWriter.java、FooSeq、FooTypeSupport.java，Foo\\_publication.java）。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            629,
            840,
            669
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 使用java 编译，将编译输出至文件夹 out下：",
        "bbox": [
            205,
            696,
            589,
            713
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "javac –cp 安装目录/lib/ZRDDS\\_JAVA.jar –d out \\*.java",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            721,
            603,
            738
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/771e54dead9bd7fb62ed0e83251f42b8b8f4a83e0fa07bb6da0bc1a43de7a082.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            188,
            740,
            877,
            829
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "输出",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            837,
            223,
            852
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/d28e1ad4e23892d5e22ecff8982a88b2ba694804b8dd6c8539177f6a057dc609.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td colspan=\"2\">名称</td><td>修改日期</td><td>类型</td><td>大小</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Foo.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>1 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Foo_publication.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>4KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Foo_subscription.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>3 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>FooDataReader.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>1 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>FooDataWriter.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>1 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>FooSeq.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>1 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>FooTypeSupport.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>5 KB</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>TestDataReaderListener.class</td><td>2020/5/6 16:18</td><td>CLASS 文件</td><td>3KB</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            90,
            798,
            239
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " 进入 out 文件夹下使用 java 运行：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            206,
            273,
            500,
            290
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "java –cp [ZRDDS\\_JAVA.jar];[ZRDDS\\_JAVA.dll];. Foo\\_publication",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            238,
            298,
            692,
            313
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Foo\\_publication.java 中带有 main 函数",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            321,
            473,
            337
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/9878727ac5b9dfb36371af0c21f5659862ac6a89b60f8f42ed345f314d7263d8.jpg",
